  - id: ch6-ex-01
    type: single-choice
    lessonId: 
    topic: 
    difficulty: 2
    tags: []
    source: GT 2021, tr. 205
    chapterId: tthcm-ch6
    prompt: "M\u1EE5c ti\xEAu v\u1EC1 ki\u1EBFn th\u1EE9c c\u1EE7a Ch\u01B0\u01A1ng 6 l\xE0 g\xEC?"
    explanation: "Ng\u01B0\u1EDDi h\u1ECDc bi\u1EBFt th\u1EC3 hi\u1EC7n tr\xE1ch nhi\u1EC7m x\xE2y d\u1EF1ng v\u0103n h\xF3a, \u0111\u1EA1o \u0111\u1EE9c, con ng\u01B0\u1EDDi Vi\u1EC7t Nam hi\u1EC7n nay."
    promptVN: "M\u1EE5c ti\xEAu v\u1EC1 ki\u1EBFn th\u1EE9c c\u1EE7a Ch\u01B0\u01A1ng 6 l\xE0 g\xEC?"
    explanationVN: "Ng\u01B0\u1EDDi h\u1ECDc bi\u1EBFt th\u1EC3 hi\u1EC7n tr\xE1ch nhi\u1EC7m x\xE2y d\u1EF1ng v\u0103n h\xF3a, \u0111\u1EA1o \u0111\u1EE9c, con ng\u01B0\u1EDDi Vi\u1EC7t Nam hi\u1EC7n nay."
    options:
    - id: A
      text: "Cung c\u1EA5p ki\u1EBFn th\u1EE9c c\u01A1 b\u1EA3n v\u1EC1 t\u01B0 t\u01B0\u1EDFng H\u1ED3 Ch\xED Minh v\u1EC1 v\u0103n h\xF3a, \u0111\u1EA1o \u0111\u1EE9c, con ng\u01B0\u1EDDi v\xE0 v\u1EADn d\u1EE5ng v\xE0o th\u1EF1c ti\u1EC5n"
      textVN: "Cung c\u1EA5p ki\u1EBFn th\u1EE9c c\u01A1 b\u1EA3n v\u1EC1 t\u01B0 t\u01B0\u1EDFng H\u1ED3 Ch\xED Minh v\u1EC1 v\u0103n h\xF3a, \u0111\u1EA1o \u0111\u1EE9c, con ng\u01B0\u1EDDi v\xE0 v\u1EADn d\u1EE5ng v\xE0o th\u1EF1c ti\u1EC5n"
      side: 
    - id: B
      text: "H\u1ECDc thu\u1ED9c ng\xE0y th\xE1ng"
      textVN: "H\u1ECDc thu\u1ED9c ng\xE0y th\xE1ng"
      side: 
    - id: C
      text: "Ch\u1EC9 h\u1ECDc v\u1EC1 kinh t\u1EBF"
      textVN: "Ch\u1EC9 h\u1ECDc v\u1EC1 kinh t\u1EBF"
      side: 
    - id: D
      text: "Ch\u1EC9 h\u1ECDc v\u1EC1 qu\xE2n s\u1EF1"
      textVN: "Ch\u1EC9 h\u1ECDc v\u1EC1 qu\xE2n s\u1EF1"
      side: 
    correctOptionIds:
    - A
  - id: ch6-ex-02
    type: single-choice
    lessonId: 
    topic: 
    difficulty: 2
    tags: []
    source: GT 2021, tr. 205
    chapterId: tthcm-ch6
    prompt: "M\u1EE5c ti\xEAu v\u1EC1 t\u01B0 t\u01B0\u1EDFng c\u1EE7a Ch\u01B0\u01A1ng 6 g\u1ED3m \u0111i\u1EC1u g\xEC?"
    explanation: "\u0110\xF3 l\xE0 m\u1EE5c ti\xEAu v\u1EC1 t\u01B0 t\u01B0\u1EDFng."
    promptVN: "M\u1EE5c ti\xEAu v\u1EC1 t\u01B0 t\u01B0\u1EDFng c\u1EE7a Ch\u01B0\u01A1ng 6 g\u1ED3m \u0111i\u1EC1u g\xEC?"
    explanationVN: "\u0110\xF3 l\xE0 m\u1EE5c ti\xEAu v\u1EC1 t\u01B0 t\u01B0\u1EDFng."
    options:
    - id: A
      text: "Ni\u1EC1m tin v\xE0o gi\xE1 tr\u1ECB t\u01B0 t\u01B0\u1EDFng H\u1ED3 Ch\xED Minh v\xE0 ch\u1ED1ng c\xE1c quan \u0111i\u1EC3m sai tr\xE1i, lu\u1EADn \u0111i\u1EC7u th\xF9 \u0111\u1ECBch"
